					"nextDialogs": [
						60160405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60160405,
					"content": "我本来就叫这个，有什么奇怪的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60160406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奈芙尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 60160406,
					"content": "意思是不加任何称谓，直呼其名。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60160407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60160407,
					"content": "什么意思？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60160408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奈芙尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 60160408,
					"content": "也许可以证明我们的关系变融洽了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60160409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60160409,
					"content": "多么美丽的错觉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60160410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奈芙尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 60160410,
					"content": "奈芙尔！菈乌玛！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60160411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60160411,
					"content": "#派蒙，{NICKNAME}。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60160412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60160412,
					"content": "我们来看看你们的情况！准备得还顺利吗？有好好休息吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60160413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60160413,
					"content": "放心吧，不会拖大家后腿的。",
