					"nextDialogs": [
						60160414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奈芙尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 60160414,
					"content": "我也会全力帮助大家取得胜利。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60160415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60160415,
					"content": "对了，请允许我给你们稍微检查一下…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60160416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60160416,
					"content": "…好了。两位的状态都不错，真是再好不过了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60160417,
						60160418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60160417,
					"content": "托大家的福。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60160419
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60160419,
					"content": "不用客气。你不比我们任何人轻松，所以你也要好好休息，直到迎战多托雷的那一刻。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60160420
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奈芙尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 60160420,
					"content": "#放心吧，我会监督{M#他}{F#她}的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60160421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60160421,
					"content": "那就好。派蒙自己也要注意休息哦。",
